##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# GitHub issue #3 (spec 017, US3) regression: photonmap() silently
# no-op under the JIT. Queries a nonexistent .pm file (deterministic
# empty-photon-map lookup, see shaders/photonmap_probe.sl header) -- not
# stochastic, no numthreads requirement despite photon lookups
# generally being RNG-adjacent in real usage.
version 3.03
Hider "reyes"
Option "shaderformat" "default" ["rslo"]
Display "sphere-photonmap-reyes.tif" "file" "rgba"
Projection "perspective"
Clipping 0.1 100
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
  Surface "photonmap_probe"
  Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
